* Chunk naming: retain intermediate values while performing mental arithmetic.
Goal: Add two numbers mentally
. Goal: Hear problem
.. Hear <27>
.. Hear plus <15>
. Goal: Add ones digits
.. Think <7> plus <5>
.. Store <12>
. Goal: Add tens digits
.. Recall <27>
.. Recall <15>
.. Think <2> plus <1> plus <1>
.. Store <4>
. Goal: Report answer
.. Recall <4>
.. Recall <12>
.. Say <42>
